WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.800
Dawn breaks over layered hills.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.600
The sun climbs while the clouds drift east.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.800
Night again: northern lights ripple above a still lake.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.600
Their glow is mirrored in the water.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.800
Evening at sea, the sun touching the horizon.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.600
Light glitters on the slow swell.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.800
Back in the hills, dusk turns to night.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.200
The moon rises and the first stars appear.
